      Densidad y volumen visible\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto pt-6 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-3-5\" data-name=\"product 3 purchase footer\">\n                        <span class=\"font-serif\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-3-5-1\" data-name=\"product 3 price\" style=\"color:#D4916E;font-size:22px;\">\n                            $18\n                        </span>\n                        <a class=\"label link-ul\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-3-5-2\" data-name=\"product 3 whatsapp link\" href=\"#contacto\">\n                            Pedir por WhatsApp\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                </article>\n                <article class=\"reveal group p-6 flex flex-col\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-4\" data-name=\"product card 4\" style=\"border-right:1px solid #C5BEB6;border-bottom:1px solid #C5BEB6;\">\n                    <div class=\"prod-panel aspect-square flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden mb-6\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"product card image wrapper\">\n                        <img alt=\"Navaja y hojillas\" class=\"w-full h-full object-contain p-3 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"product 4 image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/products/navaja-hojillas.png\"/>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"label mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"product 4 category label\" style=\"color:#3D3D3D;\">\n                        Navaja con hojillas\n                    </p>\n                    <h3 class=\"font-serif\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-4-3\" data-name=\"product 4 title\" style=\"font-size:24px;\">\n                        Navaja + Hojillas\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"mt-1 font-light\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-4-4\" data-name=\"product 4 description\" style=\"color:#3D3D3D;font-size:14px;\">\n                        Perfilado limpi