trabajar. Ya no compro en otro lado.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-8 pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-3\" data-name=\"testimonial 1 footer\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #C5BEB6;\">\n                    <p class=\"font-mono\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"testimonial 1 author name\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">\n                        Ricardo Méndez\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"label mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"testimonial 1 author role\" style=\"color:#3D3D3D;\">\n                        Barbero, Caracas\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"reveal p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-2\" data-name=\"testimonial 2 card\" style=\"background:#F3EBE2;\">\n                <span class=\"font-serif text-6xl leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-2-1\" data-name=\"testimonial quote mark\" style=\"color:#D4916E;\">\n                    “\n                </span>\n                <p class=\"font-serif italic font-light -mt-4\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-2-2\" data-name=\"testimonial 2 text\" style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;\">\n                    Precio de barbería de verdad y despacho en un día. La asesoría se agradece.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-8 pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-2-3\" data-name=\"testimonial 2 footer\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #C5BEB6;\">\n                    <p class=\"font-mono\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"testimonial 2 author name\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">\n                        Luis Ferreira\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"label mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"testimonial 2 author role\" style=\"color:#3D3D3D;\">\n                        Barbero, Valencia\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"reveal p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-3\" data-name=\"testimonial 3 card\" style=\"background:#F3EBE2;\">\n                <span class=\"font-serif text-6xl leading-none\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-3-1\" data-name=\"testimonial quote mark\" style=\"color:#D4916E;\">\n                    “\n                </span>\n                <p class=\"font-serif italic font-light -mt-4\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-3-2\" data-name=\"testimonial 3 text\" style=\"font-size:22px;line-height:1.5;\">\n                    Productos que aguantan el día a día. EduardoPro entiende el oficio.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-8 pt-6\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-3-3\" data-name=\"testimonial 3 footer\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #C5BEB6;\">\n                    <p class=\"font-mono\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-3-3-1\" data-name=\"testimonial 3 author name\" style=\"font-size:14px;\">\n                        Andrés Salcedo\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"label mt-1\" data-kid=\"1-6-3-3-3-2\" data-name=\"testimonial 3 author role\" style=\"color:#3D3D3D;\">\n                        Barbero, Maracaibo\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- CONTACTO + FOOTER (dark) -->\n    <section data-kid=\"1-7\" data-name=\"contact section\" id=\"contacto\" style=\"background:#1A1A1A;color:#F3EBE2;\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-[1440px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-16 py-24 md:py-32\" data-kid=\"1-7-1\" data-name=\"contact section inner container\">\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-14 md:gap-24\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1\" data-name=\"contact grid layout\">\n                <div class=\"reveal\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-1\" data-name=\"contact info container\">\n                    <p class=\"label mb-5\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"contact category label\" style=\"color:#D4916E;\">\n                        Contacto\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"font-serif font-light leading-tight\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"contact headline\" style=\"font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,72px);\">\n                        Hablemos\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-7 max-w-[420px] font-light\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"contact description text\" style=\"color:#C5BEB6;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;\">\n                        Haz tu pedido directo por WhatsApp o déjanos un mensaje. Te asesoramos y coordinamos el envío a todo el país en 24 horas.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-10 flex items-center gap-3 label\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-1-4\" data-name=\"whatsapp divider group\" style=\"color:#D4916E;\">\n                        <span class=\"w-8 h-px\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"whatsapp divider line\" style=\"background:#D4916E;\">\n                        </span>\n                        Pedidos por WhatsApp\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <form class=\"reveal\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2\" data-name=\"contact form\" onsubmit=\"return false\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-8\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"name input group\">\n                        <label class=\"label block mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"name label\" style=\"color:#C5BEB6;\">\n                            Nombre\n                        </label>\n                        <input class=\"w-full bg-transparent pb-3 outline-hidden placeholder:text-white/30\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"name input field\" placeholder=\"Tu nombre\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #4a4a4a;color:#F3EBE2;font-size:16px;\" type=\"text\"/>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mb-8\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"whatsapp input group\">\n                        <label class=\"label block mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"whatsapp label\" style=\"color:#C5BEB6;\">\n                            WhatsApp\n                        </label>\n                        <input class=\"w-full bg-transparent pb-3 outline-hidden placeholder:text-white/30\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"whatsapp input field\" placeholder=\"+58 ___ ___ ____\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #4a4a4a;color:#F3EBE2;font-size:16px;\" type=\"text\"/>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mb-10\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"message input group\">\n                        <label class=\"label block mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"message label\" style=\"color:#C5BEB6;\">\n                            Mensaje\n                        </label>\n                        <textarea class=\"w-full bg-transparent pb-3 outline-hidden placeholder:text-white/30 resize-none\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"message text area\" placeholder=\"¿Qué necesitas?\" rows=\"3\" style=\"border-bottom:1px solid #4a4a4a;color:#F3EBE2;font-size:16px;\"></textarea>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"label px-8 py-4 btn-fill w-full sm:w-auto\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"send message button\" style=\"background:#D4916E;color:#1A1A1A;border-radius:4px;\">\n                        Enviar mensaje\n                    </button>\n                </form>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-24 hairline h-px w-full\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-2\" data-name=\"footer separator line\" style=\"opacity:.25;\">\n            </div>\n            <footer class=\"pt-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3\" data-name=\"footer branding container\">\n                <span class=\"font-serif\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-1\" data-name=\"footer logo text\" style=\"font-size:26px;\">\n                    EduardoPro\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"label\" data-kid=\"1-7-1-3-2\" data-name=\"copyright notice text\" style=\"color:#C5BEB6;\">\n                    © 2026 EduardoPro — Todos los derechos reservados\n                </span>\n            </footer>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <script>\n        const reveals=document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');\n    const io=new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{\n      entries.forEach(e=>{if(e.isIntersecting){e.target.classList.add('in');io.unobserve(e.target);}});\n    },{threshold:0.08,rootMargin:'0px 0px -8% 0px'});\n    reveals.forEach((el,i)=>{el.style.transitionDelay=(i%4*0.07)+'s';io.observe(el);});\n    // Safety fallback: guarantee visibility even if observer never fires (e.g. full-page capture)\n    setTimeout(()=>{reveals.forEach(el=>el.classList.add('in'));},1400);\n    </script>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-07-20T21:50:57.919858+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-07-20T21:50:57.919858+00:00",
      "id": "var_93eaba9ba05f",
      "viewportScrollY": 35
    },
    "var_34dbb826da63": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "EduardoPro — Dark & Bold",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 3080,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 800
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;0,900;1,400;1,500;1,600&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap');\n\n  #ep-root {\n    --bg: #171412;\n    --bg2: #1A1A1A;\n    --cream: #F3EBE2;\n    --ink: #B8AEA4;\n    --accent: #D4916E;\n    --hair: rgba(245,235,226,0.20);\n    background: var(--bg);\n    color: var(--cream);\n    font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n  }\n  #ep-root .ff-serif { font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; }\n  #ep-root .ff-mono { font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace; }\n\n  @keyframes ep-marquee {\n    from { transform: translateX(0); }\n    to { transform: translateX(-50%); }\n  }\n  #ep-root .ep-marquee-track {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n    animation: ep-marquee 26s linear infinite;\n  }\n\n  #ep-root .reveal {\n    opacity: 0;\n    transform: translateY(34px);\n    transition: opacity 0.9s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1), transform 0.9s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1);\n  }\n  #ep-root .reveal.in {\n    opacity: 1;\n    transform: translateY(0);\n  }\n\n  #ep-root .prod-card:hover .prod-img { transform: scale(1.06); }\n  #ep-root .prod-card:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }\n  #ep-root .prod-img { transition: transform .7s cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); }\n\n  #ep-root .btn-accent:hover { background: #e0a17f; }\n  #ep-root .btn-outline:hover { background: var(--cream); color: var(--bg); }\n  #ep-root .wa-link:hover { color: var(--accent); }\n  #ep-root .navlink { position: relative; }\n  #ep-root .navlink::after {\n    content:''; position:absolute; left:0; bottom:-6px; height:1px; width:0; background: var(--accent);\n    transition: width .4s ease;\n  }\n  #ep-root .navlink:hover::after { width:100%; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"overflow-x-clip\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"page layout container\" id=\"ep-root\">\n    <!-- NAVBAR -->\n    <nav class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"main navigation bar\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 py-6 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-1-1\" data-name=\"navigation content wrapper\">\n            <a class=\"ff-serif text-[26px] md:text-[30px] font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--cream)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo link\" href=\"#\">\n                EduardoPro\n            </a>\n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-9 ff-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.22em] text-[var(--ink)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"navigation menu links container\">\n                <a class=\"navlink hover:text-[var(--cream)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"navigation link 1\" href=\"#oficio\">\n                    EL OFICIO\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"navlink hover:text-[var(--cream)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"navigation link 2\" href=\"#coleccion\">\n                    COLECCIÓN\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"navlink hover:text-[var(--cream)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"navigation link 3\" href=\"#testimonios\">\n                    TESTIMONIOS\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <a class=\"btn-accent ff-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] bg-[var(--accent)] text-[#171412] px-6 py-3 font-medium transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-1-1-3\" data-name=\"contact call-to-action button\" href=\"#contacto\">\n                CONTACTO\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n    <!-- HERO -->\n    <header class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-end overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"hero section\">\n        <img alt=\"Barbershop\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero background image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503951914875-452162b0f3f1?auto=format&w=1600&q=80&fit=crop\"/>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-2\" data-name=\"hero background gradient overlay\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(15,12,10,0.78) 0%, rgba(15,12,10,0.55) 40%, rgba(15,12,10,0.94) 100%);\">\n        </div>\n        <!-- corner labels -->\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-6 md:left-10 ff-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.28em] text-[var(--ink)] z-10 flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-3\" data-name=\"hero bottom-left label\">\n            <span class=\"w-6 h-px bg-[var(--accent)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"hero decorative line 1\">\n            </span>\n            EST. 2020\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"absolute bottom-8 right-6 md:right-10 ff-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.28em] text-[var(--ink)] z-10 flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-2-4\" data-name=\"hero bottom-right label\">\n            ENVÍOS A TODO EL PAÍS\n            <span class=\"w-6 h-px bg-[var(--accent)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"hero decorative line 2\">\n            </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 w-full pb-24 md:pb-32\" data-kid=\"1-2-5\" data-name=\"hero text content wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"reveal\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"hero text content group\" data-reason=\"class toggled by intersection observer to reveal content\">\n                <p class=\"ff-mono text-[11px] md:text-[12px] tracking-[0.32em] text-[var(--accent)] mb-6\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"hero sub-headline\">\n                    HERRAMIENTAS · CUIDADO · RITUAL\n                </p>\n                <h1 class=\"ff-serif font-bold leading-[0.95] text-[15vw] md:text-[8.5vw] tracking-tight max-w-[16ch]\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"hero main headline\">\n                    El ritual del\n                    <span class=\"text-[var(--accent)] italic\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"hero headline emphasized text\">\n                        caballero\n                    </span>\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"mt-8 max-w-xl text-[var(--ink)] text-[18px] md:text-[21px] leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-3\" data-name=\"hero description text\">\n                    Herramientas y productos de grado profesional para quienes toman el cuidado en serio. Precio de barbería, calidad que aguanta la silla.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-4\" data-name=\"hero action buttons container\">\n                    <a class=\"btn-accent ff-mono text-[12px] tracking-[0.2em] bg-[var(--accent)] text-[#171412] px-9 py-4 font-medium text-center transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-4-1\" data-name=\"explore collection button\" href=\"#coleccion\">\n                        EXPLORAR COLECCIÓN\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"btn-outline ff-mono text-[12px] tracking-[0.2em] border border-[var(--cream)]/60 text-[var(--cream)] px-9 py-4 font-medium text-center transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-2-5-1-4-2\" data-name=\"whatsapp contact button\" href=\"#contacto\">\n                        HABLAR POR WHATSAPP\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <!-- MARQUEE -->\n    <div class=\"bg-[var(--accent)] text-[#171412] py-4 overflow-hidden\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"marquee text bar\">\n        <div class=\"ep-marquee-track ff-mono text-[13px] tracking-[0.25em] font-medium\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"marquee scrolling track\">\n            <span class=\"px-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"marquee text 1\">\n                CALIDAD GARANTIZADA\n            </span>\n            <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"marquee separator 1\">\n                ✦\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"px-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-3\" data-name=\"marquee text 2\">\n                ENVÍO EN 24 HORAS\n            </span>\n            <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-4\" data-name=\"marquee separator 2\">\n                ✦\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"px-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-5\" data-name=\"marquee text 3\">\n                ASESORÍA EXPERTA\n            </span>\n            <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-6\" data-name=\"marquee separator 3\">\n                ✦\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"px-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-7\" data-name=\"marquee text 4\">\n                PAGO SEGURO\n            </span>\n            <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-8\" data-name=\"marquee separator 4\">\n                ✦\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"px-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-9\" data-name=\"marquee text 5\">\n                CALIDAD GARANTIZADA\n            </span>\n            <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-10\" data-name=\"marquee separator 5\">\n                ✦\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"px-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-11\" data-name=\"marquee text 6\">\n                ENVÍO EN 24 HORAS\n            </span>\n            <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-12\" data-name=\"marquee separator 6\">\n                ✦\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"px-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-13\" data-name=\"marquee text 7\">\n                ASESORÍA EXPERTA\n            </span>\n            <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-14\" data-name=\"marquee separator 7\">\n                ✦\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"px-6\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-15\" data-name=\"marquee text 8\">\n                PAGO SEGURO\n            </span>\n            <span data-kid=\"1-3-1-16\" data-name=\"marquee separator 8\">\n                ✦\n            </span>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    <!-- EL OFICIO -->\n    <section class=\"bg-[var(--bg)] py-24 md:py-32\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"about us section\" id=\"oficio\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-14 lg:gap-20 items-center\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-name=\"about content container\">\n            <div class=\"reveal order-2 lg:order-1\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"about text group\" data-reason=\"class toggled by intersection observer to reveal content\">\n                <p class=\"ff-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-[var(--accent)] mb-6\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"about section sub-headline\">\n                    EL OFICIO\n                </p>\n                <h2 class=\"ff-serif font-bold text-[42px] md:text-[58px] leading-[1.02] tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"about section main headline\">\n                    El oficio,\n                    <br data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n                    bien hecho\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"mt-7 text-[var(--ink)] text-[17px] leading-relaxed max-w-lg\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-3\" data-name=\"about section description text\">\n                    Compramos directo a distribuidores. Tú recibes precio de barbería y productos que aguantan el día a día en la silla.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-12 space-y-0\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4\" data-name=\"about feature list container\">\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-6 py-7 border-t border-[var(--hair)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-1\" data-name=\"feature 1 item\">\n                        <span class=\"ff-serif text-[var(--accent)] text-[34px] leading-none italic\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"feature 1 index number\">\n                            01\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"feature 1 text container\">\n                            <h3 class=\"ff-serif text-[22px] mb-1\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"feature 1 title\">\n                                Calidad garantizada\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-[var(--ink)] text-[15px] leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"feature 1 description\">\n                                Marcas probadas en barberías reales. Nada que no usaríamos nosotros.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-6 py-7 border-t border-[var(--hair)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"feature 2 item\">\n                        <span class=\"ff-serif text-[var(--accent)] text-[34px] leading-none italic\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"feature 2 index number\">\n                            02\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"feature 2 text container\">\n                            <h3 class=\"ff-serif text-[22px] mb-1\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"feature 2 title\">\n                                Envío en 24 horas\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-[var(--ink)] text-[15px] leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"feature 2 description\">\n                                Despachamos rápido a todo el país. Tu pedido no espera.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-6 py-7 border-t border-b border-[var(--hair)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-3\" data-name=\"feature 3 item\">\n                        <span class=\"ff-serif text-[var(--accent)] text-[34px] leading-none italic\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-3-1\" data-name=\"feature 3 index number\">\n                            03\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-3-2\" data-name=\"feature 3 text container\">\n                            <h3 class=\"ff-serif text-[22px] mb-1\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-3-2-1\" data-name=\"feature 3 title\">\n                                Asesoría experta\n                            </h3>\n                            <p class=\"text-[var(--ink)] text-[15px] leading-relaxed\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1-4-3-2-2\" data-name=\"feature 3 description\">\n                                Te ayudamos a elegir la herramienta correcta para tu estilo.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"reveal order-1 lg:order-2 relative\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"about image container\" data-reason=\"class toggled by intersection observer to reveal content\">\n                <img alt=\"Barbero trabajando\" class=\"w-full h-[420px] md:h-[620px] object-cover bg-[#211d19]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"about section image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1599351431202-1e0f0137899a?auto=format&w=900&q=80&fit=crop\"/>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-5 left-5 ff-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.28em] bg-[var(--bg)]/80 text-[var(--cream)] px-4 py-2 backdrop-blur-sm\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"about image caption label\">\n                    DESDE 2020 · CARACAS\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <!-- COLECCIÓN -->\n    <section class=\"bg-[var(--bg2)] py-24 md:py-32 border-t border-[var(--hair)]\" data-kid=\"1-5\" data-name=\"products collection section\" id=\"coleccion\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 md:px-10\" data-kid=\"1-5-1\" data-name=\"collection content container\">\n            <div class=\"reveal flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between gap-6 mb-14\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"collection header group\" data-reason=\"class toggled by intersection observer to reveal content\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"collection section sub-headline container\">\n                    <p class=\"ff-mono text-[11px] tracking-[0.3em] text-[var(--accent)] mb-5\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"collection sub-headline\">\n                        COLECCIÓN\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"ff-serif font-bold text-[46px] md:text-[68px] leading-none tracking-tight\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"collection main headline\">\n                        La colección\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-[var(--ink)] text-[15px] max-w-sm md:text-right\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-2\" data-name=\"collection description text\">\n                    Cuatro esenciales que no pueden faltar. Elige, pide por WhatsApp y recíbelo en casa.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2\" data-name=\"products grid container\">\n                <!-- card -->\n                <div class=\"prod-card reveal group border border-[var(--hair)] bg-[var(--bg)] transition-colors duration-500 flex flex-col\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"product card 1\" data-reason=\"class toggled by intersection observer to reveal content\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden bg-[#211d19]\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"product card 1 image container\">\n                        <img alt=\"Máquina Wahl\" class=\"prod-img w-full h-56 object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"product card 1 image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/products/maquina-wahl.png\"/>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-6 flex flex-col flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"product card 1 info container\">\n                        <p class=\"ff-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.24em] text-[var(--ink)] mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"product card 1 category\">\n                            MÁQUINA PROFESIONAL\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 class=\"ff-serif text-[24px] mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"product card 1 name\">\n                            Máquina Wahl\n                        </h3>\n                        <div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between pt-4 border-t border-[var(--hair)]\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"product card 1 price container\">\n                            <span class=\"ff-serif text-[var(--accent)] text-[26px]\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"product card 1 price\">\n                                $85\n                            </span>\n                            <a class=\"wa-link ff-mono text-[12px] tracking-[0.16em] text-[var(--cream)] transition-colors\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"product card 1 link\" href=\"#contacto\">\n                                PEDIR →\n                            </a>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"prod-card reveal group border border-[var(--hair)] bg-[var(--bg)] transition-colors duration-500 flex flex-col\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"product card 2\" data-reason=\"class toggled by intersection observer to reveal content\">\n                    <div class=\"overflow-hidden bg-[#211d19]\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"product card 2 image container\">\n                        <img alt=\"Cera Rolda\" class=\"prod-img w-full h-56 object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"product card 2 image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/api/local/images/products/cera-rolda.png\"/>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"p-6 flex flex-col flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"product card 2 info container\">\n                        <p class=\"ff-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.24em] text-[var(--ink)] mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"product card 2 category\">\n                            CERA DE PEINADO MATE\n                        </p>\n                        <h3 class=\"ff-serif text-[24px] mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-2-2-2